    "detailed_description": "Space fight arena is a retro arcade based arena shooter game that was modeled after legendary arcade games. This game retains the fun, addicting aspects of those arcade games while also adding on new, awesome features such as challenges, skins, and a world wide leaderboard. Play and complete all the challenges, unlock all of the skins, and climb to the very top of the leaderboard. Space Fight Arena has so much to offer and the best part is that more and more content will continue to be added weekly!",
